						<div class="tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content">
				<div class="xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs">Archery enthusiasts have something exciting to look forward to this august at <a href="https://www.dentongo.com/">Denton Go (Denton Hill State Park)</a> in Potter County.</div>
<div></div>
<div class="xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs">Plan now to be part of the fun when Shot the 3D Experience revives one of Pennsylvania&#8217;s premier outdoor archery destinations by bringing a world-class 3D archery event back to the site. Shot the 3D Experience has built a reputation over the past few years presenting some of the nation&#8217;s most exciting &#8220;mega shoots.&#8221; While the organization has primarily held events throughout the Midwest, this marks its first-ever appearance in Pennsylvania.</div>
<div></div>
<div class="xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs">The event will take place August 6–9, 2026, and will feature five professionally designed courses, each consisting of 30 lifelike 3D animal targets, for a total of more than 150 targets spread throughout the beautiful terrain of Denton Hill State Park. Each course will offer a unique theme and varying levels of difficulty, providing an enjoyable experience for shooters of every age and skill level.</div>
<div></div>
<p>Participants may pre-register online at www.shot3dx.com or register on-site the day they wish to shoot. A day pass includes unlimited shooting, allowing archers to complete every course or spend the day enjoying their favorites at their own pace. Attendees can enjoy a variety of outdoor vendors, archery-<br />
related exhibits, and food trucks, making the event a destination for the entire family.</p>
<p>Event: The Denton 3D Classic with Shot the 3D Experience</p>
<p>Dates: August 6–9, 2026</p>
<p>Courses: Five unique 30-target courses</p>
<p>Targets: More than 200 lifelike 3D targets</p>
<div></div>
<div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s"></div>
